WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.328
Putt-putt-putt!

2
00:00:08.329 --> 00:00:12.203
Brum-brum!

3
00:00:12.204 --> 00:00:16.064
"What is that sound?" asked Cow.

4
00:00:16.065 --> 00:00:19.155
Brum-brum-brum!

5
00:00:19.156 --> 00:00:22.347
Brum-brum!

6
00:00:22.348 --> 00:00:26.278
"I think it's Farmer's tractor," said Bat.

7
00:00:26.279 --> 00:00:30.843
"It can't be Farmer's tractor," said Cat.

8
00:00:30.844 --> 00:00:35.606
"Farmer went to town."

9
00:00:35.607 --> 00:00:45.170
"Nobody else drives the tractor," said Dog.

10
00:00:45.171 --> 00:00:50.370
Putt-putt-putt!

11
00:00:50.371 --> 00:00:54.415
"It is the tractor," said Bat.

12
00:00:54.416 --> 00:00:57.553
"But Farmer is not driving it!"

13
00:00:57.554 --> 00:01:02.298
"Who is driving it?" asked Dog.

14
00:01:02.299 --> 00:01:05.768
"Pig!" said Bat.

15
00:01:05.769 --> 00:01:11.853
"Pig?" said Dog and Cow and Cat.

16
00:01:11.854 --> 00:01:17.292
Everyone ran outside.

17
00:01:17.293 --> 00:01:26.792
Brum-brum-brum!

18
00:01:26.793 --> 00:01:30.464
"Look at me!" cried Pig.

19
00:01:30.465 --> 00:01:33.827
"I'm driving the tractor!"

20
00:01:33.828 --> 00:01:36.861
"Uh-oh," said Cow.

21
00:01:36.862 --> 00:01:41.067
"That's not a good idea, Pig."

22
00:01:41.068 --> 00:01:44.853
"Are you kidding?" said Pig.

23
00:01:44.854 --> 00:01:47.652
"This is a great idea!

24
00:01:47.653 --> 00:01:51.411
It's a lot of fun!"

25
00:01:51.412 --> 00:01:54.510
"Pig!" said Dog.

26
00:01:54.511 --> 00:01:56.796
"Look out!"

27
00:01:56.797 --> 00:02:01.855
"You guys should try . . ." said Pig.

28
00:02:01.856 --> 00:02:04.472
"Uh-oh!"

29
00:02:04.473 --> 00:02:09.297
Sploosh!

